# A journey of one's own (SCENE): each scene's STAYS (as TRAVELS, or 4 .. 128 bars of its own: it moves on even
# with TRAVELS by hand), PLAYS (SKIPPED: travelling, PRESET and MORPH pass it by), BRING IN (a scene of any
# journey over the scene shown, SEL twice), and SEL held with K1 moving the scene shown earlier or later.
autoplay 0
wait 300
tap EDIT
expect view 2
turn SELECT 12
expect srow 12
turn K2 2
expect stays1 2
turn K1 1
turn SELECT 1
expect srow 13
turn K2 -1
expect skip2 1
shot scene_plays.png
tap HOME
# scene 1 stays 8 bars (90 BPM: 21 s), then on to scene 3, scene 2 passed by
tap SEQ
wait 20000
expect scene 1
wait 15000
expect scene 3
# PRESET back: scene 1, past the skipped one
turn PRESET -1
wait 13000
expect scene 1
# BRING IN: PENUMBRA's second scene (its key D) over scene 4
tap EDIT
turn K1 3
turn SELECT 3
expect srow 16
turn K2 1
turn K3 1
tap SEL
expect sroot4 9
tap SEL
expect sroot4 2
shot bring_in.png
# SEL held, K1: scene 4 moves to be scene 3 (scene 3, in F, to 4)
press SEL
turn K1 -1
release SEL
expect sroot3 2
expect sroot4 5
expect skip2 1
expect nscenes 4
